	(text_box "START_OK = [NOT OC AND NOT idle current (IDLE_ANY) AND NOT FLT] AND [RDY AND WIN AND RAIL_OK] AND [LB_LOCK AND MODE_OK]; RAIL_OK = BR5_OK AND LSD_OK (rev 0.3 D-9).\nMODE_OK = shock mode: XFER (relay left rest, with K_EN on and the contact SEEN AT REST when K_EN rose (K_WAS_REST, U1277, rev 0.3 D-15), for >= 10 ms) AND KWIN_N (coil on for less than 45.7-51.8 ms)\nOR test mode: TM AND K_AT_REST (patient relay at rest) AND BTOK (test relay enabled >= 4.74 ms, rev 0.3 D-16).\nXFER: AND3(K_LEFT, K_EN_I, K_WAS_REST) -> 110 k / 100 nF -> TLV7031 at 0.640: 10.42-12.17 ms [SIM LR §1.3] (emptied through a BAS116 when an input drops, and fully through Q1201 2N7002 + 10 ohm while the contact is back at rest, D-14:\n11.0-11.3 ms after the last release for bounces >= 15 us [SIM rev3-wpd]). BTOK (rev 0.3 D-16): BTEST_EN_I -> 49.9 k thin film / 100 nF C0G -> TLV7031 at 0.640 (56.2 k / 100 k): 4.74-5.52 ms [SIM LR §1.3], above the test relay's 3 ms\noperate time.\nEvery intermediate node has a 100 k pull-down: a dead gate refuses the start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 407.86 0)
		(size 269.705 17.113)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
