	(text_box "One SN74LVC2G07 per controller, so each controller's view has its own part. SEQ_ACT = ACT, SEQ_DONE = NOT RUN_L (planned end or fault), BR_FAULT = FLT, which since rev 0.3 (D-17) also reports the\nper-phase caps and LSD_OK low (contract issue 3 §5.7). Pull-ups on 04 (3V3_MAIN) and 05 (3V3_SUP); with BRIDGE_3V3 off the outputs are released (Ioff) = 'not active / not done / no fault' (contract\n§5.7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 592.415 704.687 0)
		(size 227.875 8.477)
